      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat client itself is using Unity 2019. Check the development updates every two weeks for any updates. No time frame available, but they are actually working on it. \n\nI am curious why your avatar requires newer Unity. Like, I can understand issues with export to older Unity, but you should be able to take the 3d model and textures and reassemble in the 2019 Unity editor",
