      "statusChangeID": "6511a592ff6cad0a60a81fa3",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Hi @{648c4172751d66955c2d8fa2|full_name}! Thanks for posting on our feedback board.\n\nVRChat is running on Unity 2019. That's why the Creator Companion doesn't support newer Unity versions - they simply wouldn't work after uploading them to VRChat.\n\nHowever, VRChat will be updating to Unity's most recent LTS (Long-Term Support) version soon! That'll be Unity 2022 LTS. Please keep an eye on our developer updates on ask.vrchat.com to find out when it's ready.\n\nPlease let me know if you have any other questions. Have a nice day!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
